{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17112","headline":"月暎清淮流 · 徐敞","name":"月暎清淮流","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"遥夜淮弥净，浮空月正明。\n虚无含气白，凝澹暎波清。\n见底深还浅，居高缺复盈。\n处柔知坎德，持洁表阴精。\n利物功难并，和光道已成。\n安流方利涉，应鉴此时情。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐敞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}